use finance
# Words whose argument sits on different sides in different languages.
contract Pieces
parties issuer, supplier, bank

asset Receivable
  amount HKD
  due date
  holder supplier

can split with parts
  requires sum of parts = amount
  requires sum of parts before due > HKD 0
  requires (sum of parts) before due > HKD 0
  requires count of parts < 5
  requires consent of bank before due
  requires consent of (bank)
  requires at most 3 = count of parts
when within 30 days before due notify bank
when 7 days before due notify issuer
